        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Shoutout to ABD Garage – The Real Deal!\n\nMy wife and her friend have been bringing their vehicles to ABD auto marine in  for years, and I finally decided to see what the hype was about. After working in the car business for 24 years, I’ve become a bit of a car snob—finding a garage with honest, skilled mechanics has always been a challenge.\n\nWell, let me tell you… ABD blew me away.\n\nThis is hands-down the best garage I’ve ever been to. The team at ABD knows cars inside and out, treats their clients with real respect, and delivers high-quality work with incredible turnaround time. It’s rare to find a place that combines expertise, service, and speed so well.\n\nThey’ve completely taken the stress out of maintaining my vehicles—both now and in the future. Whether it’s automotive or marine, this is the shop you can trust.\n\nIf you’re tired of second-guessing where to bring your vehicle, don’t wait. Call ABD today and book your appointment.\nGreat people. Great work. Go team ABD!",
        "time": 1750083927,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
